          "title": "You'll want to know: ખતરો",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ખતરો — khatro — \"a peril\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જો આ જૂના પુલ પર ભારે ગાડીઓ ચાલશે તો ખતરો છે. jo ā jūnā pul par bhāre gāḍīo cālśe to khatro che. If heavy vehicles use this old bridge, it is dangerous."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ખતરો (khatro) is usually traced to Arabic khaṭar, \"danger, risk\", through Persian."
            }
          ]
        },
