          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "વેઠવું (veṭhvũ) is built on veṭh, \"forced labour\", which CDIAL traces to Sanskrit viṣṭi (CDIAL 11989); \"to endure hardship\" is the verb's sense, which CDIAL does not give."
            }
