            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A figure? (આંકડો, ā̃kḍo.) A calculation? (ગણતરી, gaṇtarī.) A finding? (તારણ, tāraṇ.) A count? (સંખ્યા, sankhyā.) To bring down? (ઘટાડવું, ghaṭāḍvũ.) A discovery? (શોધ, śodh.) An observation? (અવલોકન, avlokan.) Proven? (સિદ્ધ, siddh.) A mystery? (રહસ્ય, rahasya.) To uncover? (ઉઘાડવું, ughāḍvũ.) A principle? (સિદ્ધાંત, siddhā̃t.) Everyday practice? (વ્યવહાર, vyavhār.) An inference? (અનુમાન, anumān.) Actual? (વાસ્તવિક, vāstavik.) To link? (સાંકળવું, sā̃kaḷvũ.) A stipulation? (શરત, śarat.) Possible? (શક્ય, śakya.) A likelihood? (સંભાવના, sambhāvnā.) A conjecture? (અટકળ, aṭkaḷ.) To want? (ચાહવું, cāhvũ.) Probably? (સંભવતઃ, sambhavataḥ.) Without fail? (અચૂક, acūk.) Definite? (નિશ્ચિત, niścit.) An assumption? (ધારણા, dhārṇā.) To assess? (આંકવું, ā̃kvũ.) Luck? (નસીબ, nasīb.) Destiny? (ભાગ્ય, bhāgya.) A coincidence? (સંયોગ, sanyog.) To bear fruit? (ફળવું, phaḷvũ.) To turn out? (નીવડવું, nīvaḍvũ.) Dread? (ભય, bhay.) Terror? (દહેશત, daheśat.) Peace of mind? (નિરાંત, nirā̃t.) A misgiving? (આશંકા, āśankā.) To frighten? (ડરાવવું, ḍarāvvũ.) A peril? (ખતરો, khatro.) Harm? (હાનિ, hāni.) A misfortune? (આપત્તિ, āpatti.) To spoil? (બગાડવું, bagāḍvũ.) To put up with? (વેઠવું, veṭhvũ.)"
